After `shopify app generate extension` (Checkout UI, name rewards-checkout, Preact), replace the generated
shopify.extension.toml with this, KEEPING ITS OWN uid LINE:

api_version = "2026-07"

[[extensions]]
name = "Rewards checkout"
handle = "rewards-checkout"
type = "ui_extension"
uid = "KEEP-THE-GENERATED-VALUE"

[[extensions.targeting]]
module = "./src/ThankYou.jsx"
target = "purchase.thank-you.block.render"

[extensions.capabilities]
network_access = true

Then delete the generated example file in extensions\rewards-checkout\src\ (e.g. Checkout.jsx).
